                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a73bf82-ade4-3d1c-b622-3c4c65f93165",
                                        "entry_id": "8c02204f-9388-3b79-934d-07e8eff56a7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fear of crossing the street."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fff57a36-d503-4297-a3e8-49140000d8b7",
                                                "sense_id": "5a73bf82-ade4-3d1c-b622-3c4c65f93165",
                                                "text": "The man suffers from two paralyzing fears: anablephobia, the fear of looking up, and agyrophobia, the fear of crossing the street. Imagine suffering from the inability to see what is in front of you coupled with the inability to step off the curb."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6470b06-1ef2-4e5f-a45a-ff74c147d093",
                                                "sense_id": "5a73bf82-ade4-3d1c-b622-3c4c65f93165",
                                                "text": "As an example of this phobia class, James at 42 years old felt simultaneously confused and embarrassed by his agyrophobia, a fear of crossing streets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d92ada3-3839-4e48-8e00-51a9f15d9cd7",
                                                "sense_id": "5a73bf82-ade4-3d1c-b622-3c4c65f93165",
                                                "text": "In contrast to some other human phobias that people acquire with experience—like triskaidekaphobia (fear of the number 13) and agyrophobia (fear of crossing the street)—claustrophobia appears to be innate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4eb9d58d-4068-46c0-9833-bf91f47081a2",
                                                "sense_id": "5a73bf82-ade4-3d1c-b622-3c4c65f93165",
                                                "text": "Bryan, Webz and Chip sneak over an optical crosswalk spelling 'AGYROPHOBIA' wearing PIXILATED MASKS OF THEIR OWN FACES."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
